From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:52:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 81/94] IOP: pace synchronous waits when host audio plays live

Outside-thread delay, semaphore and event-flag waits can advance a full IOP second while the EE is blocked. Pace those scheduler loops against host time for live output so SPU2 does not overflow its ring and starve during subsequent EE budget repayment. Deterministic hosts retain unpaced execution; cycle accounting is unchanged.

The event-wait regression fails without pacing and verifies live elapsed time plus exact EE budget credit. Full tests and slow tests pass; the FIFA Street match route reaches live play with zero underruns.

